* Generic educational 0.18um-class Level-1 MOS models (NOT a foundry PDK)
* Process corner values come from corner.inc (.param vtn vtp kpn kpp)
* Flicker (1/f) KF values were chosen empirically to give a ~10 kHz-class 1/f corner for these
* device sizes (representative of 0.18um-class CMOS). Thermal noise is model-independent and is
* verified against hand calculation; 1/f numbers are representative only.
.model nmos nmos level=1 vto={vtn} kp={kpn} gamma=0.4 phi=0.8 lambda=0.08
+ tox=4e-9 cgso=3e-10 cgdo=3e-10 cj=1e-3 cjsw=2e-10 mj=0.5 mjsw=0.33 pb=0.9
+ kf=4e-31 af=1
.model pmos pmos level=1 vto={vtp} kp={kpp} gamma=0.4 phi=0.8 lambda=0.10
+ tox=4e-9 cgso=3e-10 cgdo=3e-10 cj=1e-3 cjsw=2e-10 mj=0.5 mjsw=0.33 pb=0.9
+ kf=4e-32 af=1
